// Instrument Light: Instrument v0.1 (look 0.2.0), light. Every fill is the ink (#0d0d0d) mixed into the surface (#ffffff) at a multiple of 4%:
// frame #f5f5f5 (4%), hover #ececec (8%), selected and hairline #e2e2e2 (12%), control line #d8d8d8 (16%).
// The ink is #0d0d0d so tool rows (a fixed 58% of the ink) hold 4.5:1 on the card fill.
// No accent hue: no accent colour is set, so the accent is the ink and selection is the neutral fill; the palette's hues are for status. Corners: panes 12 = control 8 + inset 4.
